  "solution": "Given expression: 5 × 7 - 4 + 21 ÷ 6 = 29 \n\n1. 6 and 5\n\n__**6 × 7**__ - 4 + __**21 ÷ 5**__ = 29 \n\n⇒ __**42**__ - 4 __**+ 4.2**__ = 29\n\n⇒ __**46.2 - 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 42.2 ≠ 29\n\n2. 5 and 4\n\n__**4 × 7**__ - 5 + __**21 ÷ 6**__ = 29 \n\n⇒ __**28**__ - 5 __**+ 3.5**__ = 29\n\n⇒ __**31.5 - 5**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 26.5 ≠ 29\n\n3. 6 and 7\n\n__**5 × 6**__ - 4 + __**21 ÷ 7**__ = 29 \n\n⇒ __**30**__ - 4 __**+ 3**__ = 29\n\n⇒ __**33 - 4**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 29 = 29\n\n4. 21 and 29\n\n__**5 × 7**__ - 4 + __**29 ÷ 6**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**35 **__- 4 __**+ 4.83**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**39.83 - 4**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 35.83 ≠ 29\n\nHence, ‘**6 and 7**’ is the correct answer.",
